{"final":{"answer":"$143.9 million","value":143.9,"unit":"millions of dollars","sources":["source:t1c2n0","source:t8c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"Unrecognized tax benefits began fiscal 2007 at $70.5 million (balance at beginning of year, 2007 column) and ended fiscal 2008 at $214.4 million (balance at December 27, 2008). The increase observed over 2007 and 2008 is 214.4 - 70.5 = $143.9 million."}}